```
# Database schema files are typically version controlled, so no ignores needed for SQL files
# Only ignore common artifacts if present in project

# Compiled/Binary files
*.pyc
*.class
*.o
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.a
*.obj
*.out

# Dependencies
node_modules/
venv/
